1
00:00:04,314 --> 00:00:13,784
Start by creating an account
Your data is private. Nobody else can see it.

2
00:00:13,786 --> 00:00:18,730
Not from the faculty?
Leave the code empty. Everything else works the same for you.

3
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:30,015
Your overview
Today’s tasks, your timetable, exam countdowns and cards to review.

4
00:00:30,018 --> 00:00:40,462
Add your courses
University courses or anything you study on your own.

5
00:00:40,464 --> 00:00:45,693
Your weekly timetable
Lectures, sections, labs and your own study sessions.

6
00:00:45,695 --> 00:00:50,398
Tasks and deadlines
Each task has a course, a day to do it and a deadline.

7
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:58,149
You get reminded before the deadline
1 day, 12 hours and 1 hour before, on your phone and laptop.

8
00:00:58,151 --> 00:01:13,962
Your exam timetable
Countdowns, and how heavy each exam is.

9
00:01:13,963 --> 00:01:22,464
A study plan in one click
Pick your hours per day and rest days.

10
00:01:22,467 --> 00:01:30,323
Closest and heaviest exams first
The day before each exam is its final review.

11
00:01:30,326 --> 00:01:38,823
Sessions land in My day
Each one has a focus timer, and your study time is saved.

12
00:01:38,824 --> 00:01:48,254
Flashcards from your notes
Already writing “question :: answer” in Obsidian? They are picked up.

13
00:01:48,255 --> 00:01:53,004
Or let the assistant write them
You choose which cards to keep.

14
00:01:53,006 --> 00:02:09,786
Review a few minutes a day
Again, Hard, Good or Easy decides when each card comes back, like Anki.

15
00:02:09,788 --> 00:02:20,307
Competitive programming
Link your Codeforces and LeetCode accounts. No password needed.

16
00:02:20,308 --> 00:02:25,141
Rating, solved problems and your streak
Plus the topics you practise most.

17
00:02:25,142 --> 00:02:31,037
A problem of the day and upcoming contests
One click puts a contest in your plan and your calendar.

18
00:02:31,038 --> 00:02:36,802
The AI assistant
The first time, it asks for your own free API key.

19
00:02:36,803 --> 00:02:43,018
Get a free key from Groq
console.groq.com/keys → Create API Key → copy the key starting with gsk_

20
00:02:43,024 --> 00:02:52,510
Write like you text a friend
It adds tasks and timetable slots for you.

21
00:02:52,513 --> 00:02:58,627
Done, all added
With deadlines, and linked to the right course.

22
00:02:58,628 --> 00:03:03,459
Bring your Obsidian notes
Upload your notes folder or a ZIP of it.

23
00:03:03,463 --> 00:03:10,752
Notes look clean
Math, code, callouts, tables and diagrams all render.

24
00:03:10,755 --> 00:03:20,081
Weekly review
Hours studied, time per course, finished tasks and your streak.

25
00:03:20,083 --> 00:03:30,735
Your plan in Google or iPhone Calendar
A private link: deadlines, timetable, exams and contests, always up to date.

26
00:03:30,738 --> 00:03:40,763
Study together
Share a course with a code. Friends get their own copy of its notes, tasks, exams and cards.

27
00:03:40,764 --> 00:03:51,844
Four themes, including dark
Calm, Rose, Lavender and Dark. Arabic or English, on any device.
